                        "review": "!!! DO NOT BUY IT!!!!\n\nSo the game has a very beautiful graphics and here is finishing the good part of the game.\n\nThe game lacs performance and the optimization. I have a very very good PC anyone can check my configuration on my steam profile and even with my 5090 GPU I still have great spike lags frame drops from 160 FPS to 20-30 FPS. Every time you will get close to the smallest city the game starts to move in pictures!\n\nThe game constantly lags no matter what you do, I tried different configuration different graphics settings lower the graphics settings even down scale the resolution that I'm playing nothing helps this this game cannot run in constant frames per second no matter what you do so it is very pitifully that the performance of the game it's greatly affected.\n\nWith the last update that came a few days back they said that they fixed even the AI traffic in England DLC, well I want to say that isn't like that.\n\nSo England DLC supposed to be left hand side driving on a left-hand side driving you have to give priority to your right, always to your right it seems that the AI traffic even on England you see they still follow the left hand priority system not the right hand priority how it supose to be, so you will constantly see AI traffic in England entering the roundabouts without giving priority, making a right turns without giving priority, they will change lanes without the giving priority, so you will going to be hit constantly by AI traffic that is set to give priority or on a wrong way for a left hand side driving style.\n\nOld problems that never got fixed or they don't care to fix:\n\nAi cars freezing in the middle of the road with nothing in front of them.\n\nTires model looks horrendous no matter the graphics settings.\n\nNo Ai pedestrians in the city's.",
